      <div type="clause" n="35">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Af">Af</ref> 35</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XXXII} Gif mon cierliscne mon gebinde unsynnigne, gebete mid X scill.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If someone binds an innocent ceorl, let [the man who bound him] compensate with 10 shillings.1</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If anyone lays bonds on an unoffending commoner, he shall pay 10 shillings compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">XXXII. Gif mon cierliscne mon gebinde unsynnigne, gebete mid X scll'.</ab>
      </div>
